{
  "_about": [
    "Labelled charge sequences for the recurrence (cadence) baseline.",
    "Each case is one vendor's charges — dates and amounts — and the cadence a",
    "human bookkeeper would assign. `expected` may name a cadence the engine",
    "does not have (bimonthly, semiannual): that is the point, it records a gap.",
    "Scored by src/lib/baseline.js with detectRecurring(); a case that returns",
    "no group (fewer than two charges) is read as 'single'."
